{"last_link_id": 13, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314.0001220703125], "pos": [2254.9208984375, 752.4201049804688], "widgets_values": ["2b07e1d18fa066be7814fe78bfa36b3ca2806141df1d27cdb920ddfafd3b6bc2.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314.0001220703125], "pos": [1833.8924560546875, 750.8004760742188], "widgets_values": ["pasted/2380e4c1cfc4c47b7848dc4f1d121b7e0482914db52810240fda99a3cb990b0f.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#c09430", "widgets_values": ["## 节点\n\n### OmniVoice 长文本 TTS\n\n支持长文本语音合成，带智能分段和可选的语音克隆。`ref_audio` 为可选 —— 不连接时将自动生成声音。\n\n### OmniVoice 语音克隆 TTS\n\n从参考音频中克隆声音。必须提供 `ref_audio`。不支持分段 —— 长文本请使用长文本 TTS。\n\n### OmniVoice 语音设计 TTS\n\n根据文本描述设计合成声音。无需参考音频。\n\n### OmniVoice 多说话人 TTS\n\n使用 `[Speaker_N]:` 标签生成多角色对话。在 ComfyUI >= 0.8.1 中支持动态说话人输入。\n\n### OmniVoice Whisper 加载器\n\n预加载 Whisper ASR，避免每次运行重复下载。连接到任意 TTS 节点的 `whisper_model` 输入。\n\n---\n\n## 生成参数\n\n| 参数                   | 默认值  | 范围      | 描述                       |\n| -------------------- | ---- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| steps                | 32   | 4-64    | 扩散步数。16=更快，32=均衡，64=最佳质量 |\n| guidance_scale       | 2.0  | 0-10    | 无分类器引导。越高=越贴近文本          |\n| t_shift              | 0.1  | 0-1     | 时间步偏移。越小=更强调早期步骤         |\n| speed                | 1.0  | 0.5-2.0 | 语速。>1=更快，<1=更慢           |\n| duration             | 0.0  | 0-60    | 固定输出时长（秒）。会覆盖 speed。0=自动 |\n| position_temperature | 5.0  | 0-20    | 掩码位置随机性。0=贪心，越高=越随机      |\n| class_temperature    | 0.0  | 0-5     | token 采样随机性。0=贪心，越高=越随机  |\n| layer_penalty_factor | 5.0  | 0-20    | 对更深层 codebook 的惩罚        |\n| denoise              | True | —       | 添加去噪 token 以获得更干净的输出     |\n| preprocess_prompt    | True | —       | 清理参考音频（去除静音、添加标点）        |\n| postprocess_output   | True | —       | 去除生成音频中的长静音              |\n| keep_model_loaded    | True | —       | 保持模型加载（运行间隙卸载到 CPU）      |\n\n**仅限长文本 TTS：**\n\n| 参数              | 默认值 | 范围    | 描述                  |\n| --------------- | --- | ----- | ------------------- |\n| words_per_chunk | 100 | 0-500 | 每段词数。0=不分段。在句子边界处分割 |\n\n---\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "-", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [652.5516357421875, 853.042236328125], "pos": [801.0648193359375, 1309.1102294921875], "id": 19, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "whisper_model", "links": [4], "label": "whisper_model", "type": "WHISPER_ASR", "localized_name": "whisper_model"}], "size": [361.8119812011719, 109.72552490234375], "pos": [1580.718994140625, 1552.0247802734375], "widgets_values": ["whisper-large-v3", "auto", "fp16"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "dtype"}, "name": "dtype", "label": "dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "dtype"